6:["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground","children":"Purushartha is the Vedic framework for a complete human life. It recognizes that spirituality does not reject worldly life but seeks to order it properly. Dharma provides ethical alignment, Artha supports material stability, Kama acknowledges desire and enjoyment, and Moksha points beyond all limitation to liberation. This framework integrates human life rather than splitting it into sacred versus secular."}]
7:["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground mt-4","children":"Purushartha is a foundational ethical and civilizational framework in Sanatan Dharma. It helps explain how worldly responsibility and spiritual aspiration can coexist without contradiction."}]
